msgid ""
"Gateway (VPS) → router. Only takes effect for MPTCP’s bpf_dscp scheduler "
"(pins the VPS’s own send-side choice via dscp_remote_id) and can be a "
"different WAN than Upload."
msgstr ""
"网关 (VPS) → 路由器。仅对 MPTCP 的 bpf_dscp 调度器生效（通过 dscp_remote_id 固定 VPS "
"自身的发送侧选择），可以与上传所用的 WAN 不同。"

